<main id="main" class="clinic-content">
  <p class="eyebrow">A SEPARATE WORKSPACE</p><h1>Your clinic starts here.</h1>
  <p class="clinic-lead">EHR, inventory, and employee management have their own navigation and access permissions. An APPly launch account does not automatically grant clinic access.</p>
  <section class="clinic-card"><h2>No clinic assigned yet.</h2>
    <% if development_demo? %>
      <p>Create an isolated fictional clinic to explore the working prototype. Nothing is connected to SharePoint or a live clinical system.</p>
      <%= button_to "Create demo clinic", clinic_demo_path, class: "primary-link" %>
    <% else %><p>Clinic access must be provisioned separately. For the local walkthrough, sign out and choose “Continue as demo client” on the login page.</p><% end %>
  </section>
</main>
